---
title: fork() 创建进程时序图
type: sequence
tags: [进程管理, fork, clone, 系统调用]
description: 从用户态调用 fork() 到子进程被唤醒的完整调用链(kernel_clone → copy_process)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as 用户进程
    participant Libc as libc
    participant Sys as 系统调用层
    participant Fork as kernel/fork.c<br/>kernel_clone()
    participant Copy as copy_process()
    participant Sched as 调度器
    participant Child as 子进程

    App->>Libc: fork()
    Libc->>Sys: syscall(SYS_clone)
    Sys->>Fork: kernel_clone(args)
    Fork->>Copy: copy_process(NULL, trace, ...)
    Note over Copy: dup_task_struct()<br/>复制 task_struct + 内核栈
    Copy->>Copy: copy_mm() 复制地址空间<br/>(COW 写时复制)
    Copy->>Copy: copy_fs() / copy_files()<br/>copy_sighand() / copy_signal()
    Copy->>Copy: copy_thread()<br/>复制寄存器上下文<br/>子进程返回 0
    Copy-->>Fork: 返回新 task_struct(p)
    Fork->>Sched: wake_up_new_task(p)
    Sched-->>Child: 唤醒,置为 TASK_RUNNING
    Child->>App: 返回 0(子进程)
    Fork-->>App: 返回子进程 PID(父进程)
